 if it's a  couple of hours that might benefit the  patient so don't be afraid is my thing  challenge the vendors encourage them to  get involved with your solution set and  that you know get as much information as  you can to make a good decision I think  the time is now to consider and do this  Michael thank you again for your time  today and for your important research  I'd also like to thank lab roots and our  sponsor Abbott molecular for  underwriting today's educational webcast  and before we go I'd like to thank the  audience members for joining us today  and for their interesting questions  questions we didn't have time for today  and those submitted during the on dance  demand period will be addressed by the  speaker via contact information you  provided at the time of registration the  webcast can be viewed on-demand and  labret swil alert you via email when  it's available for replay we encourage  you to share this email with your  colleagues who may have missed today's  live event until next time bye bye
 

